Z"},{"number":5327,"title":"Configure resources (plugin/css,etc) loading order","comments":10,"created_at":"2023-08-09T21:46:34Z"},{"number":5505,"title":"Remove the \"Press ESC to exit\" functionality.","comments":9,"created_at":"2024-06-28T06:25:47Z"},{"number":4389,"title":"Board view : severe performance degradation due to abundant SQL queries","comments":8,"created_at":"2020-01-08T19:03:07Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":5911,"title":"FrankBoard — modernization fork (cleaner UI, Docker-first, migration-friendly)","comments":2,"category":"Show and tell","created_at":"2026-09-28T20:34:55Z"},{"number":5848,"title":"Fyi, another kanban project is using the name Kanboard","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-07-09T18:27:52Z"},{"number":5817,"title":"Default Sort on User Dashboard","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-05-13T15:43:04Z"},{"number":5919,"title":"[Configuration]: Lost in setting TRUSTED_PROXY_NETWORKS","comments":1,"category":"Installation & Configuration","created_at":"2026-04-09T13:08:03Z"},{"number":5770,"title":"Integration with Subtaskdate plugin to display subtask deadlines into Gantt plugin","comments":0,"category":"Ideas","created_at":"2026-02-06T15:17:13Z"},{"number":5760,"title":"Problem Recurring task on cancelled project","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-01-26T08:11:51Z"},{"number":5758,"title":"edit the overview of a project or add metadata fiels","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-01-16T11:43:44Z"},{"number":5741,"title":"Hakboard - Home Assistant integration and automation for Kanboard","comments":0,"category":"Show and tell","created_at":"2025-12-01T17:18:11Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"Kanboard 1.2.57","tag":"v1.2.57","published_at":"2026-10-31T00:52:06Z","body":"### Security fixes\r\n\r\n* Disable PHP session upload progress in the Docker image to mitigate [CVE-2026-115560](https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-23-1).\r\n* Check that the user can access the opposite task's project before adding internal links with bulk changes.\r\n* Hide projects the caller cannot access from the API procedures `getProjectByName`, `getProjectByIdentifier`, and `getProjectByEmail`:\r\n  * They now return `false` instead of a 403 error that revealed the project exists.\r\n\r\n### Improvements\r\n\r\n* Allow searching users by their exact email address:\r\n  * Emails are matched exactly and case-insensitively, so partial searches cannot be used to discover other users' addresses.\r\n\r\n### Bug fixes\r\n\r\n* Make text searches case-insensitive for non-ASCII characters with SQLite.\r\n* Fix PHP 8.5 and PHP-FPM configuration issues in the Docker image.\r\n* Remove PHP 8.5 deprecation warnings.\r\n\r\n### Dependencies and build\r\n\r\n* Remove the unused `composer.json` from the bundled Symfony EventDispatcher, which triggered a false-positive Dependabot alert.\r\n* Update several GitHub Actions.","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}